WEBVTT

00:03:28.996 --> 00:03:32.788
and adjust your message to facilitate
greater understanding.

00:03:32.954 --> 00:03:34.038
Two:

00:03:34.079 --> 00:03:37.496
listen with your eyes and ears,
as well as with your gut.

00:03:37.538 --> 00:03:40.663
Remember that communication
is more than just words.

00:03:40.829 --> 00:03:41.913
Three:

00:03:41.954 --> 00:03:45.746
take time to understand
as you try to be understood.

00:03:45.788 --> 00:03:47.579
In the rush to express ourselves,

00:03:47.621 --> 00:03:51.329
it's easy to forget that communication
is a two-way street.

00:03:51.371 --> 00:03:53.454
Be open to what
the other person might say.

00:03:54.204 --> 00:03:55.663
And finally, four:

00:03:55.704 --> 00:03:58.788
be aware of your personal
perceptual filters.

00:03:58.829 --> 00:04:00.454
Elements of your experience,